    "investigate": {
      "phase": "investigate",
      "attempts": [
        {
          "attempt": 1,
          "status": "completed",
          "leaseEpoch": 1,
          "restartAction": "resume investigate attempt 1",
          "evidence": [
            "`attach()` invokes `#reconcileWorkflowProjection` and then resumes a persisted parent node through `#runParentNode`.",
            "`#reconcileWorkflowProjection` derives `awaitingMerge` from a running merge node without checking `state.effects` for a durable merge effect.",
            "`#runParentNode` projects `workflowStageForNodeTransition(node.node, \"started\")` before reading durable run state, so merge recovery writes `workflow:awaiting-merge` even after a merge effect exists.",
            "The merge path records `effect.recorded` before attempting the merged projection and before completing the node, establishing the crash window.",
            "Existing lifecycle coverage in `test/workflows/work-on.test.ts` validates pure mapping only and does not cover durable-effect dominance during resumed projection."
          ],
          "inputArtifactHash": "sha256:resolve-issue-147-7817370b",
          "logicalNodeId": "investigate-1",
          "startedAt": "2026-08-27T12:46:41.515Z",
